iring coverage remain needed. |\r\n| `.claude/​hooks/​tests/​block-readonly-role-writes.test.sh` | Tests read-only guard behavior. |\r\n| `.claude/​hooks/​block-readonly-role-writes.sh` | Adds source-write protection; Bash redirects can bypass it and role policy can drift. |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/dancing-bear-show/dancing-bear/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>"
